          "description": "5/day, a Pulsian silver chocobo can create a magical barrier to protect itself, granting the Protect, Regen, and Shell status to itself for 1d6 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 3rd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 21).",
          "notes": {
