        },
        {
          "name": "Choco Thunder",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "7/day, a Pulsian silver chocobo can shoot lightning at an opponent within 30 ft. The Pulsian silver chocobo must make a ranged touch attack (+13), if it hits, the attack deals 3d6+5 lightning damage and inflicts the Static status effect for 1d4 rounds (Reflex save DC 19 to negate). Blue mages may learn this ability as a 2nd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 19).",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Climbing",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "Pulsian silver chocobos are natural climbers. It has a climb speed of 30 feet and gains a +8 bonus on Climb checks. It can also take 10 on Climb checks, even if stress or distractions would otherwise prevent it from doing so. Also, it is never flat-footed while climbing.",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cloudwalking",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "Pulsian silver chocobos can tread on clouds or fog as though on solid ground.",
          "notes": {
